                                                                                
 Usage: amu [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...                                         
                                                                                
 amu · Anti-Messup · TWC Thugs — scope guardrail for AI code edits, built on    
 the Entire CLI                                                                 
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --version          print version and exit                                    │
│ --help             Show this message and exit.                               │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭─ Commands ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ init           Index the repo with entire graph, snapshot it, draft config / │
│                feature map / doc map / repo skills.                          │
│ doctor         Read-only package, graph/repository health and optional MCP   │
│                diagnostics.                                                  │
│ map            Blast map: sound / guessed / unknown nodes with reason +      │
│                verify, grouped by feature.                                   │
│ impact         Inspect potential impact at a source line without saving a    │
│                map or executing a change.                                    │
│ plan           4-phase plan (additive → leaves → interior → removal).        │
│                --approve writes .amu/contract.json.                          │
│ check          Contract check; graph-relevant edits require a current        │
│                matching refresh before green.                                │
│ verify         Print and run a node's verify path. Never changes the         │
│                contract.                                                     │
│ answer         List unknowns and answer proposals, record your answer, or    │
│                confirm a reviewed proposal.                                  │
│ sync           Refresh the HEAD index + worktree snapshot; writes            │
│                .amu/sync-state.json.                                         │
│ compatibility  Compare static Python argument binding; never claims runtime  │
│                compatibility.                                                │
│ refresh        Post-edit refresh from an exact approved map; records edge    │
│                additions/removals for check/done.                            │
│ sweep          Every changed public export since the contract's base_sha     │
│                that is not in the contract.                                  │
│ docs           Doc candidates from graph diff plus worktree evidence; auto   │
│                applies sound+mapped, unshadowed candidates only.             │
│ docs-reviews   List, preview or archive review drafts independently of       │
│                candidate freshness.                                          │
│ api-manifest   Compare static API surfaces; every finding requires           │
│                documentation review.                                         │
│ benchmark      Score labeled fixtures; results describe this corpus rather   │
│                than arbitrary repositories.                                  │
│ model-preview  Show the sanitized initial chat request without making a      │
│                provider call.                                                │
│ docs-saves     Inspect recoverable documentation saves, or explicitly undo   │
│                one.                                                          │
│ docs-graph     Build the docs relationship graph: mapped sections, mentions, │
│                and local links.                                              │
│ done           Finish only after green phases and a current refresh for      │
│                every graph-relevant edit.                                    │
│ cd             Print the repo path only, so `cd "$(amu cd <name>)"` works.   │
│ find           Ranked hits from `entire graph search`, each with the signals │
│                that ranked it.                                               │
│ open           `entire graph def` for a symbol (or list a file's symbols),   │
│                then the one-line next.                                       │
│ tree           Directory tree annotated with export counts and feature       │
│                labels from feature_map.json.                                 │
│ neighbors      Explore source-checked neighboring relations (never an        │
│                approval artifact).                                           │
│ where          Def site + the file's feature + whether it is frozen in the   │
│                current contract.                                             │
│ back           Return to the previous navigation target (map / find / open)  │
│                from .amu/nav.json.                                           │
│ recent                                                                       │
│ graph          Source-checked relation graph; --format dot / mermaid for PR  │
│                descriptions.                                                 │
│ watch          Watch the working tree; update node states (▸ editing · ↯     │
│                drift) against the active contract. Never runs tests.         │
│ ask            Ask the model about this repo; it answers through the graph   │
│                tools (read-only) and proposes the next amu command.          │
│ stale          Contract/map staleness plus memory entries whose evidence     │
│                hash moved.                                                   │
│ memory         self-renovating CLAUDE.md memory block                        │
│ skills         built-in and repo skills                                      │
│ repo           workspace: add / list / use / remove / sync repos             │
│ key            model credential: set / status / remove (value is never       │
│                printed)                                                      │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
                                                                                
